        <section id="how-does-legislation-and-guidance-support-individuals-with-autism"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          How does Legislation and Guidance support individuals with autism
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>All the major pieces of legislation and guidance we have discussed underpin support for individuals with autism but we need to go further into the laws and strategies that are autism specific. Social care, health and equality legislation apply to people with autism as with anyone else, but have not been used with sufficient consistency to support them in practice.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/ua/ua_u2_s1_p2_image.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
